#. module: hr_appraisal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_appraisal/models/hr_appraisal.py:0
msgid ""
"You arrived %s months ago. Your appraisal is created and you can fill it "
"here."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານເຂົ້າມາເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ %s ເດືອນແລ້ວ. ການປະເມີນຜົນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້"
"ທີ່ນີ້."

#. module: hr_appraisal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_appraisal.hr_appraisal_goal_template_view_form
